WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.969
legion status says the daemon is running.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.996
legion state prints its admission slots and the issues it records.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.848
Its JSON shows this issue's architect, ready.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.251
legion claims list shows each claim.
